abstract: >-
  A verifier-gated legal evidence vault that separates exploratory legal generation from committed legal state. Every recorded transition is source-bound, state-bound, energy-accounted, receipt-certified, machine-auditable, externally anchored, and exportable as a portable evidence bundle.
